sequenceDiagram
    participant MT5 as MT5 Bridge
    participant CH as Channel Buffer<br/>(10K capacity)
    participant W as Worker Goroutine
    participant PQ as Parquet File

    MT5->>CH: Record(tick)
    Note over CH: Non-blocking<br/>Drop if full

    loop Worker Loop
        CH->>W: Receive tick
        W->>PQ: Write batch
        Note over W: Check rotation<br/>(time or size)
    end

    Note over W: Periodic Flush<br/>every 5 seconds

    MT5->>CH: Record(tick)
    Note over CH: Buffer FULL
    CH-->>MT5: DROP (silent)
    Note right of MT5: "Better to lose history<br/>than block Trading Engine"
